OL,3,GNEWSAMedicinal cannabis prescriptions
OL,4,Arise by 35%
OL,5,
OL,6,FDoctors prescribed nearly 20,000 more
OL,7,Fmedicinal cannabis products last year
OL,8,Fthan the year before, a freedom of
OL,9,Finformation request (FOI) has found.
OL,11,FA total of 72,065 prescriptions of
OL,12,Fcannabis-based products for medicinal
OL,13,Fuse were prescribed in 2025 - a 35%
OL,14,Frise on the 53,477 in 2024.
OL,16,FGPs have been able to prescribe
OL,17,Fcannabis-based products since 2019
OL,18,Fafter a change in the law.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
